---
title: upgrade_to_fulu (Fulu Fork Specification)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_epoch : epoch = electra.get_current_epoch(pre)
    q_epoch --> q_fork : fork = Fork(previous_version, current_version=FULU_FORK_VERSION, epoch)
    q_fork --> q_copy_base : copy genesis_time, genesis_validators_root, slot, latest_block_header
    q_copy_base --> q_copy_roots : copy block_roots, state_roots, historical_roots
    q_copy_roots --> q_copy_eth1 : copy eth1_data, eth1_data_votes, eth1_deposit_index
    q_copy_eth1 --> q_copy_validators : copy validators, balances
    q_copy_validators --> q_copy_consensus : copy randao_mixes, slashings, participation, justification_bits
    q_copy_consensus --> q_copy_checkpoints : copy checkpoints (previous, current justified, finalized)
    q_copy_checkpoints --> q_copy_sync : copy inactivity_scores, sync_committees
    q_copy_sync --> q_copy_execution : copy execution_payload_header, withdrawal indices
    q_copy_execution --> q_copy_electra : copy historical_summaries, deposit fields
    q_copy_electra --> q_copy_exits : copy exit_balance_to_consume, earliest_exit_epoch
    q_copy_exits --> q_copy_consolidation : copy consolidation fields
    q_copy_consolidation --> q_copy_pending : copy pending_deposits, partial_withdrawals, consolidations
    q_copy_pending --> q_proposer : proposer_lookahead = initialize_proposer_lookahead(pre)
    q_proposer --> [*] : return post

    note right of q_fork
        INV: Fork version chain preserved (previous_version = pre.fork.current_version)
    end note
    note right of q_proposer
        INV: proposer_lookahead is the only new field (EIP-7917)
    end note
    note right of q_copy_base
        INV: No validator balances modified during fork transition
    end note
